{
  "name": "Rescue Stalled Deals with AI: Pipeline Reactivation using HubSpot, OpenAI and Slack",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "c41c373d-a5e3-4433-830f-6bc1126e37fe",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -1800,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 4,
        "width": 520,
        "height": 760,
        "content": "## Stalled Deal Rescue: AI Pipeline Reactivation\n\nDeals go quiet and reps forget to follow up. Pipeline reviews happen monthly, but\ndecay happens daily. This workflow scans your HubSpot pipeline every morning, finds\ndeals with no activity for N days, and has AI draft a personal re-engagement email\nfor each one, grounded in the real deal context. High-value stalled deals escalate\nstraight to your manager channel on Slack.\n\n### How it works\n1. The schedule trigger runs every morning at 8 AM (press Execute on the manual\ntrigger any time to test).\n2. The Configuration node holds everything you edit once: stalled-day threshold,\nescalation rules, Slack channel, and who reviews drafts.\n3. Get Open Deals pulls your open HubSpot deals. Detect Stalled Deals computes days\nsince last activity per deal and filters the quiet ones.\n4. AI drafts a short, human re-engagement email per deal: it references the deal\nname, value, stage, and days quiet, with one low-friction call to action. No\n\"just checking in\", no buzzwords.\n5. Deals above your value bar AND stalled far past the threshold escalate to Slack\nfor the manager. Everything else becomes a ready-to-review draft emailed to the\nsales rep. Nothing is sent to prospects automatically.\n6. Every action is logged to Google Sheets: deal, days stalled, and what happened.\n\n### Setup\n1. Connect HubSpot, OpenAI, Gmail, Slack, and Google Sheets credentials.\n2. Tune the Configuration node: stalledDaysThreshold, escalationMultiplier,\nminDealValueForEscalation, slackChannelId, salesRepEmail.\n3. Create a blank Google Sheet and paste its ID into the Configuration node.\n\nYour reps review every draft before it goes out. The workflow does the watching\nand the writing; humans keep the judgment."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
